#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c. Execute the circuit of interest with antinoise {#c-execute-the-circuit-"
"of-interest-with-antinoise}"
msgstr ""
"c. I-execute ang circuit ng interes na may antinoise {#c-execute-the-"
"circuit-of-interest-with-antinoise}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c.i. Prepare template circuit by using `samplex` {#ci-prepare-template-"
"circuit-by-using-samplex}"
msgstr ""
"c.i. Maghanda ng template circuit gamit ang `samplex` {#ci-prepare-template-"
"circuit-by-using-samplex}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `samplex` is an output of the `build` method of Samplomatic, which "
"encodes all the information that is required to generate randomized "
"parameters for `template_circuit`. These are then used to set up the "
"`QuantumProgram` objects, which are in turn run on a QPU with the `Executor`"
" primitive. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain several items, which you can "
"think of as a pair of `template` and `samplex`. \n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `samplex` ay isang output ng `build` method ng Samplomatic, na nag-"
"eencode sa lahat ng impormasyong kinakailangan upang bumuo ng randomized "
"parameters para sa `template_circuit`. Ang mga ito ay pagkatapos ay "
"ginagamit upang i-set up ang `QuantumProgram` objects, na siyang pinapatakbo"
" sa QPU gamit ang `Executor` primitive. Bawat `QuantumProgram` ay maaaring "
"maglaman ng ilang items, na maaari mong isipin bilang isang pares ng "
"`template` at `samplex`. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [Hello samplomatic](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qdc-"
"challenges-2025/blob/main/day3_tutorials/Track_A/hello_samplomatic/Samplomatic%20-%20Hello%20World.ipynb)"
" tutorial for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang [Hello samplomatic](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qdc-"
"challenges-2025/blob/main/day3_tutorials/Track_A/hello_samplomatic/Samplomatic%20-%20Hello%20World.ipynb)"
" tutorial para sa detalye.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c.ii. Set up the `QuantumProgram` {#cii-set-up-the-quantumprogram}"
msgstr "c.ii. I-set up ang `QuantumProgram` {#cii-set-up-the-quantumprogram}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c.iii. Execute program with the `Executor` primitive {#ciii-execute-program-"
"with-the-executor-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"c.iii. I-execute ang program gamit ang `Executor` primitive {#ciii-execute-"
